    "emptyAlternativeHost": "GetAlternativeServiceInfosInternal substitutes the origin host before admission. A broken-key host is required to be nonempty.",
    "ownerLimit": "Equal logged NAKs do not establish that two clients share the same HttpServerProperties/pool owner."
